            "alt": {
              "segmentId": "m00328:alt:fig-00007-alt",
              "text": "Three-step reaction to form an R-substituted alpha amino acid via diethylacetamidomalonate reaction with sodium ethoxide, an alkyl halide (R X), and hydronium ion decarboxylation."
            },
            "src": "../../media/OChem_26_EC_002.jpg",
            "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "id": "fig-00008",
